# This file previously contained a single rule:
#   /*    /index.html   200
# That rule created an infinite redirect loop: /index.html matches /*, so
# Cloudflare redirected it back to /index.html forever. Cloudflare Pages
# rejects this at deploy time with error code 100324.
#
# For Cloudflare Pages SPA routing, do NOT use _redirects. Instead:
#   1. In the Cloudflare dashboard, go to your Pages site > Settings >
#      Single Page Application, and enable "Single Page Application".
#   2. Or create a wrangler.toml at the project root with:
#      [pages]
#      # SPA fallback is configured in the dashboard, not here.
#
# This file is intentionally left as documentation only. Remove it if
# you are deploying exclusively via Vercel and want to avoid confusion.